  "betydning": "FOUR poses of SAM ALONE, no opponent in these source drawings. First Sam has his yellow sword upright to his left, with three thin disconnected yellow swing streaks to its left. Second he holds the sword above his fedora, blade points right. Third and fourth subtly different side-on poses bring his left arm across and raise his hand; keep each actual silhouette and the hand gripping the yellow sword. Sam has an intentionally angular low-polygon dog head, a long pointed brown muzzle, tiny black eyes, black nose, blocky floppy brown ears, faceted blue-gray fedora and suit, white collar, dark blue/black diagonal striped tie, and large angular brown bare feet and hands. These are deliberately polygonal game avatars, so do not round the muzzle, hat, suit, hands, or feet into the usual cartoon master. No scenery, boat, Max, or second sword on the ground.",
